00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.240
"For digestion sake, you should smoke."

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.960
I mean, "No curative power
is claimed by Philip Morris,"

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:32.560
but hey, better be safe
than sorry and smoke.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:41.821
"Blow in her face and
she'll follow you anywhere."

00:20:41.821 --> 00:20:44.640
(audience laughing)
After all, no woman ever says, no.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:50.941
They're "So round, so
firm, so fully packed."

00:20:50.941 --> 00:20:54.080
(audience laughing)
After all John Wayne smoked them

00:20:54.080 --> 00:21:00.305
